  "introduction": [
    "A refined duelist who can focus the dragon spirit’s violent impulses into surgical strikes and exploitative techniques. They can channel their magic into moments of heightened awareness, where time slows and they can cut down others with greater ease. As they lean into the dragon spirit’s darker side, they eventually come to manifest that dark nature as a protective shadow that looms over them."
